# Shdeps deliberately owns a different repository-root transition journal.
# An interrupted Shdeps directory-to-link handoff can leave its exact previous
# generation parked while the canonical checkout path is absent. The generated
# installer owns neither that format nor its backup: after acquiring the shared
# checkout lock it may fill the absent canonical path with a new managed clone,
